  "notes": [
    "Directional breaker and hunter audio carries through Blackwater, with a restrained hall echo on footsteps and smooth distance falloff. The Repeater clicks and scrapes; the Reaver has heavy footfalls, deep growls and demonic pursuit screams. The Repeater's original chase recording is preserved.",
    "Search randomized wall cabinets in Blackwater. Open the door, aim at the supply and press Interact to use it immediately. Cabinets include original Blender models, worn steel, shelves, hinges and nearby maintenance props.",
    "Stamina pills reduce sprint cost by 70% for 60 active-game seconds. Batteries triple portable-light recharge for 60 seconds. Another of the same type refreshes its timer; effects do not stack. Nightmare retains its no-sprint and no-portable-light rules. Supplies are claimed once across the co-op party.",
    "Improved imported station prop resource retention for cleaner round restarts. Cabinet state and consumables reset for each run. Incompatible older clients are rejected before entering the lobby; everyone in your party should update.",
    "Windows 10/11 x64. Close the game, choose Check for updates, then Update & restart. Everyone in a co-op group should update."
  ],
